# The reflexive "attach it" trigger (CR 603.12) has Dain as its only target; Bot2 passes for the spell and for the enters trigger, then
# exiles Dain with Swords to Plowshares in response to the reflexive trigger. Its target is illegal, so it does nothing (CR 608.2b):
# the Axe stays on the battlefield, unattached, and Bot1 (the Axe's controller) gains 1 life from the Swords.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Dáin Ironfoot
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Swords to Plowshares
Island x18

