Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dáin Ironfoot.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Dáin Ironfoot)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Dáin Ironfoot
